moving the `module` attribute from function/file rule structs and updating docs/rules accordingly.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 32 out of 32 changed files in this pull request and generated 7 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tool/util/sys.go | Adds `WriteFileAtomic` helper for atomic file writes. |\r\n| tool/util/sys_test.go | Adds tests covering atomic writes, perms, and temp-file cleanup. |\r\n| tool/util/shared.go | Adds tool path/name constants (`OtelcToolExe`, legacy tool constants). |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/testdata/generate_directive.otel.instrumentation.go.golden | Golden file for generated tool file with `go:generate` directive. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/testdata/default.otel.instrumentation.go.golden | Golden file for generated tool file default output. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/sync.go | Updates go.mod writing to be atomic; refactors syncDeps + logging. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/sync_test.go | Updates syncDeps tests for new signature/logging expectations. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/state.go | Expands backup tracking to include tool files (canonical + alias). |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/state_test.go | Adds/updates tests for tool-file backup selection behavior. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/setup.go | Switches setup to AutoPin flow; refactors dependency discovery/matching ordering. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/pin.go | Introduces `Pin`/`AutoPin` implementation (generate/prune/validate, go.mod updates). |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/pin_test.go | Unit tests for pin helpers (directive generation, file generation, mod edits, matching). |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/match.go | Removes default embedded rule loading fallback; errors when no rules/tool files. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/match_test.go | Updates rule-loading tests to match new “no tool file” behavior. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/find.go | Refactors build-plan parsing and dependency discovery to be function-based with ctx logger. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/find_test.go | Updates tests for refactored build-plan listing entrypoints. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/extract.go | Renames extraction entrypoint to `extractOtelcBundle`. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/config.go | Adds tool-file source info to visits; adjusts import collection behavior. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/config_test.go | Updates config walking tests to match import collection changes. |\r\n| tool/internal/setup/add.go | Writes generated runtime file atomically; refactors debug-copy helper usage. |\r\n| tool/internal/rule/func_rule.go | Removes `module` field/validation from function rules. |\r\n| tool/internal/rule/func_rule_test.go | Removes tests that relied on `module` field behavior/validation. |\r\n| tool/internal/rule/file_rule.go | Removes `module` field/validation from file rules. |\r\n| tool/internal/rule/file_rule_test.go | Removes tests that relied on `module` field behavior/validation. |\r\n| tool/internal/ast/parser.go | Adds atomic AST file writing (`WriteFileAtomic`) using util atomic writer. |\r\n| tool/cmd/otelc/main.go | Registers the new `pin` subcommand. |\r\n| tool/cmd/otelc/cmd_pin.go | Implements the `otelc pin` CLI entrypoint and flags. |\r\n| test/testutil/infra.go | Exports `OtelcPath` helper for reuse in integration tests. |\r\n| test/integration/pin_test.go | Adds integration tests for `otelc pin` (generate, prune, validate, idempotency). |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/hook/otelc.yaml | Removes `module` fields from embedded rule YAML. |\r\n| docs/rules.md | Updates rule docs to remove `module` guidance and clarify dependency availability expectations. |\r\n| docs/getting-started.md | Documents the new `otelc pin` command and auto-pin behavior during builds. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" 